        "original_id": "2a57073a-c734-5e3b-a4dd-a380cdf7ebbc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Dolmayan, Greg Costikyan, Serj Tankian, Daron Malakian, Shavo Odadjian\n- Organizations: System of a Down, Sirius XM\n- Roles: drummer, songwriter, game designer, science fiction writer\n- Products: PopRocks\n\nFacts:\n- Greg Costikyan was born on July 22, 1959, in New York City.\n- Greg Costikyan is an American game designer and science fiction writer who is sometimes known under the pseudonym \"Designer X\".\n- John Dolmayan was born on July 15, 1973.\n- John Dolmayan is a Lebanese-born Armenian-American songwriter and drummer.\n- System of a Down currently consists of Serj Tankian on lead vocals and keyboards, Daron Malakian on vocals and guitar, Shavo Odadjian on bass and backing vocals, and John Dolmayan on drums.\n- PopRocks debuted on August 17, 2017, as a full-time Sirius XM channel devoted to pop music and rock music.\n- PopRocks has featured pop artists such as Goo Goo Dolls, Train, and Sheryl Crow, and rock artists such as Metallica and System of a Down.",
